 * Declares the ErrorGenerator class, used to store an error inside a symbol, a
 * value or a type without throwing it. It is used in class validation for
 * example, to store the error and continue the validation for other symbols,
 * while being able to throw the error again if the class is needed again
 * without needing to validate it twice.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
